On Thu, 11 May 2006, Christian Hofstede wrote:

> Is there a way of disabling explore mode in nethack ?

As Jym said, enter_explore_mode in cmd.c is responsible for entering
explore mode in the game. If you also want to disable the -X command line
switch, you have to look in the *main.c file for your system in the sys/
directory, for example, sys/share/pcmain.c.

